
Hi all....

Just a few notes for those of you upgrading from previous versions....

New field in config.dat: delaytime (read docs)
New field in qwk.cfg: reply packet (read docs)

System Reset time is a bit longer now...dont be shocked...

Modem handling a bit different...should handle any/all modems.



